    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the adrenaline-pumping world of 'RUN ON'!<br><br>presenting a permadeath game where players navigate countless obstacles and utilize various items to race to the finish line.<br><br>In 'RUN ON,' every second counts when strategizing to conquer challenging terrains. Whether you're a lone wolf striving to surpass yourself or a competitive fighter determined to outdo your friends, the thrilling environment guarantees an exhilarating experience for all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/d26e18d56334f5a130e956e3c02dc34a.poster.avif?t=1698736052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/d26e18d56334f5a130e956e3c02dc34a.webm?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/d26e18d56334f5a130e956e3c02dc34a.mp4?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The current version of 'RUN ON' available on  boasts meticulously crafted maps tailored to various difficulty levels, including Easy, Normal, and Hard.<br>As you move forward, be prepared to encounter obstacles that test your agility and reflexes. But do not afraid of it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/e5c2e89ac68ea13520b9b3c621ad9a9c.poster.avif?t=1698736052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/e5c2e89ac68ea13520b9b3c621ad9a9c.webm?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/e5c2e89ac68ea13520b9b3c621ad9a9c.mp4?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game's distinctive visuals and playful sounds, along with items, jumps, sliding, and controls, guide you through an enjoyable adventure.\u000bWhile progressing, you'll find faster routes and master efficient shortcuts. Upon completing 'RUN ON,' you can reattempt the challenge, aided by items that help improve your record.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/3a369c2409c194c0e74cef6a68bd73c9.poster.avif?t=1698736052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/3a369c2409c194c0e74cef6a68bd73c9.webm?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/3a369c2409c194c0e74cef6a68bd73c9.mp4?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game offers heart-pounding moments and thrilling escapes filled with triumphant excitement. So, tie your shoelaces, gather your friends, and embark on an unforgettable race. Your journey awaits.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to the adrenaline-pumping world of 'RUN ON'!<br><br>presenting a permadeath game where players navigate countless obstacles and utilize various items to race to the finish line.<br><br>In 'RUN ON,' every second counts when strategizing to conquer challenging terrains. Whether you're a lone wolf striving to surpass yourself or a competitive fighter determined to outdo your friends, the thrilling environment guarantees an exhilarating experience for all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/d26e18d56334f5a130e956e3c02dc34a.poster.avif?t=1698736052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/d26e18d56334f5a130e956e3c02dc34a.webm?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/d26e18d56334f5a130e956e3c02dc34a.mp4?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The current version of 'RUN ON' available on  boasts meticulously crafted maps tailored to various difficulty levels, including Easy, Normal, and Hard.<br>As you move forward, be prepared to encounter obstacles that test your agility and reflexes. But do not afraid of it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/e5c2e89ac68ea13520b9b3c621ad9a9c.poster.avif?t=1698736052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/e5c2e89ac68ea13520b9b3c621ad9a9c.webm?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/e5c2e89ac68ea13520b9b3c621ad9a9c.mp4?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game's distinctive visuals and playful sounds, along with items, jumps, sliding, and controls, guide you through an enjoyable adventure.\u000bWhile progressing, you'll find faster routes and master efficient shortcuts. Upon completing 'RUN ON,' you can reattempt the challenge, aided by items that help improve your record.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/3a369c2409c194c0e74cef6a68bd73c9.poster.avif?t=1698736052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/3a369c2409c194c0e74cef6a68bd73c9.webm?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379800/extras/3a369c2409c194c0e74cef6a68bd73c9.mp4?t=1698736052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game offers heart-pounding moments and thrilling escapes filled with triumphant excitement. So, tie your shoelaces, gather your friends, and embark on an unforgettable race. Your journey awaits.",
